    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_2",  "label": "Question 2",  "default": "Can I wash the fabric?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "faq_a_2",  "label": "Answer 2",    "default": "<p>Yes — the fabric cover is machine washable on a gentle cold cycle. Air dry only. Do not tumble dry or iron.</p>" },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_3",  "label": "Question 3",  "default": "Single vs double-side printing?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "faq_a_3",  "label": "Answer 3",    "default": "<p>Single-side is printed on the front only and is our most popular option. Double-side is visible from both sides and ideal for freestanding displays.</p>" },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_4",  "label": "Question 4",  "default": "Is the frame durable?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "faq_a_4",  "label": "Answer 4",    "default": "<p>The frame is made from aircraft-grade aluminium — lightweight yet rigid. It can be assembled and disassembled hundreds of times without wear.</p>" },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_5",  "label": "Question 5",  "default": "Can I buy fabric only?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "faq_a_5",  "label": "Answer 5",    "default": "<p>Yes. Replacement and additional fabric panels can be purchased separately from the frame.</p>" },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_6",  "label": "Question 6",  "default": "What file format?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "faq_a_6",  "label": "Answer 6",    "default": "<p>We accept PDF, AI, and EPS files at a minimum of 150 DPI at final print size.</p>" },
    { "type": "text",     "id": "faq_q_7",  "label": "Question 7" },
